---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
---
<section class="section shell" id="involved">
    <div class="news-split" data-rv>
      <div class="news-photo">
        <svg class="np-fallback" viewBox="0 0 256 256" aria-hidden="true"><g fill="none" stroke="#B4552D" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M26 196 C58 112 94 84 128 84 C162 84 198 112 230 196"/><path d="M52 196 C76 140 100 118 128 118 C156 118 180 140 204 196"/><path d="M78 196 C92 162 108 148 128 148 C148 148 164 162 178 196"/></g><circle cx="128" cy="46" r="15" fill="#33241C"/></svg>
        <Image src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1476231682828-37e571bc172f?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Morning light coming through forest leaves" width={1000} height={667} widths={[400, 600, 800, 1000]} sizes="(max-width: 1020px) calc(100vw - 32px), 570px" loading="lazy" format="webp" quality={55} onload="this.classList.add('ok')" onerror="this.remove()" />
        <p class="photo-cap">Morning in the Kubu Raya peat forest</p>
      </div>
      <div class="news-body">
        <h2>Field Notes, Once a Month.</h2>
        <p>Field Notes is our monthly email: canal water levels, survival counts, patrol findings, and what the month cost, printed there before anywhere else. One email a month, and never an appeal in between.</p>
        <form class="news-bar" id="newsForm" novalidate>
          <label for="newsEmail" style="position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0 0 0 0)">Email address</label>
          <input type="email" id="newsEmail" name="email" placeholder="Your email address" autocomplete="email" required>
          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-forest">Subscribe <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
        </form>
        <p class="form-msg" id="newsMsg" role="status" aria-live="polite" style="min-height:0"><span class="ok-sprout" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 21v-8"/><path d="M12 13c0-3.4-2.4-5.2-6.2-5.2 0 3.7 2.4 5.5 6.2 5.2Z"/><path d="M12 13c0-3.4 2.4-5.2 6.2-5.2 0 3.7-2.4 5.5-6.2 5.2Z"/></svg></span><span class="msg-txt"></span></p>
        <div class="news-join">
          <div class="avatars" aria-hidden="true"><span>AR</span><span class="a2">JM</span><span class="a3">KT</span></div>
          <p>3,240 subscribers, most of them in the districts we work in</p>
        </div>
        <div class="issues">
          <h3>Recent Issues</h3>
          <ul>
            <li><span>OCT 2026</span>Canal 14 holds: the water table rose 22 cm through the dry season</li>
            <li><span>SEP 2026</span>Second-year survival count in Kubu Raya: 71%, and where the losses sit</li>
            <li><span>AUG 2026</span>The crabs are back in the Demak rows</li>
            <li><span>JUL 2026</span>Patrol book, quarter two: three snares found, no new clearings</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="trusted" data-rv>
      <p class="t-label">WORKING ALONGSIDE</p>
      <ul aria-label="Partner organisations">
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 21v-8"/><path d="M12 13c0-3.6-2.6-5.6-6.8-5.6 0 4 2.6 6 6.8 5.6Z"/><path d="M12 13c0-3.6 2.6-5.6 6.8-5.6 0 4-2.6 6-6.8 5.6Z"/></svg>KTH Wanatani Lestari</li>
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="17" cy="6.3" r="2.3" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><path d="M2 13.5c2.6-2.2 5.2-2.2 7.8 0 2.6 2.2 5.2 2.2 7.8 0 1.7-1.4 3.4-1.8 4.4-1.2"/><path d="M2 18.5c2.6-2.2 5.2-2.2 7.8 0 2.6 2.2 5.2 2.2 7.8 0 1.7-1.4 3.4-1.8 4.4-1.2"/></svg>Koperasi Pesisir Biru</li>
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 3c5.5 4.5-5.5 7.5 0 11 2.7 2.3 3.2 4.3 2.8 7"/><path d="M15.5 3c5.5 4.5-5.5 7.5 0 11 2.7 2.3 3.2 4.3 2.8 7"/></svg>BUMDes Sungai Raya</li>
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="9.5" r="3.2"/><path d="M12 2.8v2.4M6.6 4.6l1.7 1.7M17.4 4.6l-1.7 1.7M5.2 9.5h2.2M16.6 9.5h2.2"/><path d="M4 20.5c2.6-2.2 5.3-3.3 8-3.3s5.4 1.1 8 3.3"/></svg>Poktan Cakra Tani</li>
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 4L5 19M12 4v15M12 4l7 15M3 19h18"/></svg>Karang Taruna Delta</li>
        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 3l4.8 6.2H14L19.5 15H4.5L10 9.2H7.2L12 3Z"/><path d="M12 15v6M8.5 21h7"/></svg>KTH Rimba Makmur</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
